    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses an enumerated constant.</para><para>Parses one of the strings added via <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1EnumParser_1acd6ae7979d6934afb18a1f6cc13bb4e6" kindref="member">with</ref> and returns the associated enumerated constant. The template parameter <computeroutput>T</computeroutput> is the enum type. Returns <ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ParsedValue" kindref="compound">ParsedValue</ref> whose value if type <computeroutput>T</computeroutput>. This parser uses <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1StringSetParser" kindref="compound">StringSetParser</ref>, thus it prefers to match enum members with the longest names.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__sawyer__parser__factories" kindref="compound">Command line parser factories</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
